 "words": 247,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "A decree went out from Caesar that the whole world be enrolled",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So Joseph walked with Mary down to David's town of old",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And there in Bethlehem the time had come for her to bear",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She laid him in a manger, for no room was waiting there",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Out in the fields nearby the shepherds watched their flock by night",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "An angel of the Lord appeared, the glory shining bright",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They trembled on the hillside, they were terrified and still",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the angel spoke to them across the darkness of the hill",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be afraid",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I bring you good news of great joy that is for all the people",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Today in the city of David a Savior has been born to you",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He is Christ the Lord",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Suddenly a host of heaven filled the sky with song",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let's go to Bethlehem, they said, and hurried right along",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They found Mary and Joseph and the baby where he lay",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They told what they'd been told, and all were amazed that day",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Glory to God in the highest",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And on earth peace to those on whom his favor rests",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Glory to God in the highest",
   "heard": 6,
